Design a BankAccount class that stores the following information:

Account number (String)

Account holder name (String)

Balance (double)

Requirements:

The account number and holder name must be provided at creation and cannot be changed afterwards.

The balance starts at zero, but a constructor can also accept an initial balance (must be non-negative).

Provide a deposit(double amount) method that increases the balance. The amount must be positive.

Provide a withdraw(double amount) method that decreases the balance. The amount must be positive and cannot exceed the current balance.

Provide a getBalance() method to check the balance.

Provide getters for account number and holder name.

The internal balance must never be directly modifiable from outside the class.

